  m_Text: "I want to gift tea to a friend for a birthday. We will do it for the day
    after tomorrow.\nI really need a small amount of Freshness and a little bit of
    Energy. If it isn't too much to ask, I would also need a hint of Sweetness. \nI
    need a lot of tea."
