    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "I am running out of tea. I need some in four days.\nIf it isn't too much
    to ask, I would need a small amount of Freshness + a small amount of Energy.
    If it isn't too much to ask, I would also need a hint of Tanginess. \n"
