  m_Text: "Greetings\nI want to gift tea to a friend for a birthday.\nI want to have
    something fresh but also a little relaxing. If it isn't too much to ask, I would
    also need a hint of Sweetness. \n\nCan you deliver it in four days.\nCheers"
