  m_Text: "Dear Sir or Madam,\nI need a gift for a birthday.\nCould you put something
    fresh but also a little energetic ? If it isn't too much to ask, I would also
    need an aftertaste of Tanginess. \nI want something simple.\nCould I have it
    within five days ?\nHave a great day !"
