  m_Text: "I will have guests.\nIf it isn't too much to ask, I would need a little
    bit of Warmth but also a hint of Energy. If it isn't too much to ask, I would
    also need an aftertaste of Tanginess. \nBut I don't want something complex.\nI
    would need it within four days."
