  m_Text: "I need a gift for a birthday.\nIf it isn't too much to ask, I would need
    a small amount of Freshness and a small amount of Energy. I also really need
    an aftertaste of Tanginess. \nI need a lot of tea.\nCould I have it for the day
    after tomorrow ?"
