  m_Text: "I hope this finds you well.\nI am having friends over.\nCould you put
    something fresh and not too energetic ? If it isn't too much to ask, I would
    also need a little bit of Sweetness. \nI need a lot of tea.\nCould I have it
    within three days ?\nLooking forward to recieving the tea."
