    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "I want some tea.\nIf it isn't too much to ask, I would need an aftertaste
    of Freshness and Relaxation. I also really need an aftertaste of Sweetness. \nI
    want something simple.\nCould I have it within three days ?"
